Article 4 The tax amounts for cultivated land occupation tax are as follows:
(1) In areas where the per capita cultivated land does not exceed one mu (taking counties, autonomous counties, cities not divided into districts, and municipal districts as units, the same below), the tax per square meter shall be 10 yuan to 50 yuan;
(2) In areas where the per capita cultivated land exceeds one mu but does not exceed two mu, the tax per square meter shall be 8 yuan to 40 yuan;
(3) In areas where the per capita cultivated land exceeds two mu but does not exceed three mu, the tax per square meter shall be 6 yuan to 30 yuan;
(4) In areas where the per capita cultivated land exceeds three mu, the tax per square meter shall be 5 yuan to 25 yuan.
The applicable tax amounts for cultivated land occupation tax in each region shall be proposed by the people's government of the province, autonomous region, or municipality directly under the Central Government within the range of tax amounts prescribed in the preceding paragraph based on the per capita cultivated land area and economic development, reported to the standing committee of the people's congress at the same level for determination, and filed with the Standing Committee of the National People's Congress and the State Council for record. The average level of applicable tax amounts for cultivated land occupation tax in each province, autonomous region, or municipality directly under the Central Government shall not be lower than the average tax amount prescribed in the 'Table of Average Tax Amounts for Cultivated Land Occupation Tax by Province, Autonomous Region, and Municipality' attached to this Law.
